  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**Instrucciones: el imperativo (verbo en base, sin sujeto)**",
      "",
      "*Sit down. · Open your book. · Listen and repeat. · Read the text. · Write your name. · Look at the board.*",
      "**Negativo:** *Don't use your phone.* · **Cortés:** *Please sit down.*",
      "",
      "**Frases para sobrevivir en clase**",
      "",
      "| Quiero… | Digo… |",
      "|---|---|",
      "| que lo repitan | *Can you repeat that, please?* |",
      "| que hablen más despacio | *Can you speak more slowly, please?* |",
      "| decir que no entiendo | *I don't understand.* |",
      "| saber qué significa | *What does 'wallet' mean?* |",
      "| saber cómo se dice | *How do you say 'llaves' in English?* |",
      "| saber cómo se escribe | *How do you spell it?* |",
      "",
      "**Mensajes cortos**",
      "",
      "- **Notas:** *Back at six. · Gone to the shop. · Please close the window.* (se omiten palabras: *I'll be back at six*)",
      "- **Mensajes de texto:** *Where are you? · I'm at the café. · See you soon! · Running late.*",
      "",
      "Ojo: en el imperativo no se pone *to*: *Open the door* (no *To open the door*). *Don't* + verbo base: *Don't talk.*",
      "",
      "Pronunciación: *listen* /ˈlɪsn/ (la t no suena) · *repeat* /rɪˈpiːt/."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "To open the door, please.",
        "right": "Open the door, please.",
        "note": "En el imperativo no se pone to."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "I not understand.",
        "right": "I don't understand.",
        "note": "Negación con don't."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
